The technical and quality inspection team is headed by a Deputy Provincial Governor, the Director of the Land Management Department, the Provincial Police Chief, the Provincial Police Chief and the Governor of Sihanoukville. In addition, there are members of some department heads and other relevant officials.
In addition to the task of inspecting the technical characteristics and quality of the collapsed construction, the technical and quality inspection team has the task of:
Investigate the negligent actions of officials involved in law enforcement and other causes of building collapses.
* Examine construction technical standards or detailed plans, construction components and architectural plans.
Take legal action against builders or responsible persons or managers who do not follow the instructions of the technical team.
* In case of finding that the relevant officials are at fault, action shall be taken in accordance with legal procedures.
* Attend meetings and implement action plans as determined by the team leader.
* The working group shall make a record and report on the work results to the provincial governor for review and decision.
