(Preah Sihanouk): The accident of the collapse of a 7-storey building on the morning of June 22, 2019 until more than 10 am on June 23, 2019, the death toll from the pile of buildings has risen to 17 people (Four females) and 24 injured (two females) as hundreds of rescuers continue to search for victims suspected to be trapped in the rubble.
