The United States and China are currently in a trade war, and the G20 summit is expected to focus on this issue. The United States and North Korea have been stuck in talks on nuclear weapons on the Korean Peninsula since the second summit between Trump and Kim in Hanoi, Vietnam, in February this year. Go without any agreement.
