Mr. Liv Sovanna was appointed as the defense counsel for Mr. Nuon Chea in Case 002/02
Mr. Liv Sovanna is a Cambodian lawyer with more than 10 years of experience in the private profession. From 2013 to 2017, he was a legal adviser to Nuon Chea's defense team, including during his trial in Case 002/02.
Currently, Mr. Liv Sovanna is a member of the Legal Council of the Council of Ministers and Deputy Secretary General of the Bar Association of the Kingdom of Cambodia. He is also a professor at the Lawyer Training Center.
Mr. Liv Sovanna holds a Master's Degree in Law from the Cambodian University of Specialties and a Bachelor of Laws (Second Generation) from the Cambodian Vocational Training School.
