On behalf of the entire Pre-Trial Chamber, a report has already been issued on this case file, which outlines the facts and background of the proceedings in Case 004/2, as well as the details of the appeal before the Pre-Trial Chamber.
The Pre-Trial Chamber will decide whether O'Ann meets the requirements of the court's jurisdiction and whether there are enough charges to send him to trial for the charges or charges. Charges against him will be dropped. For now, the Pre-Trial Chamber will consider issuing a ruling. This verdict is final and there is no further appeal.
