(Phnom Penh): Dara Pay, Cambodia's most advanced mobile wallet and cash payment solution provider, has signed a "Partnership Agreement with Siem Reap Water Supply Authority" to provide water bill payment methods. Modern for people living in Siem Reap.
Through this partnership agreement, DaraPay will provide Siem Reap customers with a modern, fast, reliable and reliable way to pay water bills. This state-of-the-art service will also significantly contribute to sharing difficulties, improving well-being and saving time and money for customers.
From now on, customers living in Siem Reap do not have to spend time and money to travel or queue up to pay their bills, that is, they can pay their bills immediately through the DaraPay App on their mobile phones. Or you can pay at any DaraPay agency location closest to your home.
DaraPay also offers a special promotion of 3 months free service to pay the bill to Siem Reap Water Supply Authority. Today's collaboration underscores DaraPay's willingness to innovate and provide the latest technology to Cambodians with a wide range of financial services to meet the daily needs of Cambodians.
In fact, customers can now pay instantly at more than 2,800 DaraPay supermarkets, cafes, shops and partner stores nationwide without having to carry cash.
DaraPay also offers other financial services, offering customers the option to make their own payments through the DaraPay App or payment through DaraPay agents nationwide.
Phok Ratha, General Manager of DaraPay, said: “As one of the leading financial technology companies in the country, DaraPay continues to innovate and develop its technology on a daily basis. Today, we have partnered with the Siem Reap Water Supply Authority to provide digital payment billing solutions to our customers. ”
He added that Atichon can save time and money to travel to pay for water service to Siem Reap Water Supply Authority and in the future, DaraPay will continue to expand the scope of digital water bill payment service to the provinces. Cities throughout Cambodia. At the same time, we are working diligently to develop more new financial products to serve our customers more effectively.
Mr. Khuth Vuthyarith said, "DaraPay's digital water bill payment service really provides many benefits for Siem Reap customers, such as saving time and money, creating convenience and security, not only this service also contributes significantly. In order to increase the efficiency of collecting water service fees for the Siem Reap Water Supply Authority.
Please be informed that DaraPay has many services including: Money Transfer (Money Transfer), Withdrawal / Deposit, Bill Payment, Top Up, Mobile Payment, Online Payment, Partner Payment, Credit Payment, Credit Advice, Debit Credit Salary and e-wallet.
