Notice! General Department of Immigration revises travel procedures through international gates to facilitate national and international tourists
(Phnom Penh): The General Department of Immigration, Ministry of Interior, on June 20, 2019, informed the national and international tourists on the adjustment of travel procedures through international gates to make it easier and faster. Before.
The General Department of Immigration has confirmed that in order to make it easier and faster to travel through international gates, the General Department of Immigration has decided to introduce a new model immigration card form from June 1, 2019 and will be Do the following:
* First: Decided to reduce the application for entry visa and entry-exit certificate combined into one immigration card only.
* Second: Foreigners applying for a visa upon arrival at international gates throughout Cambodia are not required to attach a photo as before.
* Third: Foreigners who need to enter Cambodia are required to fill out an immigration card to enter Cambodia, and upon departure are not required to complete an exit form.
* Fourth: Cambodian citizens who hold a Cambodian passport are not required to fill out an immigration form. Phnom Penh Governor Announces Surgery on Officers Behind Local Gambling Offenses
