Discussion on draft food standards related to quality factors, ingredients, additives, food additives, veterinary waste, labeling, etc. * Review of New Work proposed by ASEAN Codex members in Preparation of a number of food standards * Continue to review the ASEAN Joint Positioning Procedures in Response to International Codec Affairs.
