(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chea Pisey, Member of the Secretariat of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Chairman of the Russey Keo District Unity Command, told Fresh News that he was determined to crack down on all kinds of gambling at the grassroots level, especially suffix games. Vietnam, which is expanding and this problem leads to crimes that affect the people as well.
Residents in Russey Keo district strongly believe that the authorities will take all possible measures to crack down on Vietnamese lottery games, including one "K38" brand location, but the logo has been removed and is still open. Get openly played every day in a rough way, without fear of breaking the law.
