(Kratie): Mr. Pich Bunthen, Minister of Public Works, on the morning of June 17, 2019, presided over the inauguration ceremony of 21 members of Kratie Provincial Council for the third mandate and reminded the council and the authorities. Kratie province must perform its duties professionally and make it responsible and efficient.
