8. Continue to strictly enforce the law in order to prevent and suppress forest crime, fishing crime and all kinds of natural resource crimes.
9. Continue to inspect and address the challenges and necessary requests of the people through local community meetings and the organization of local public forums.
10: Continue to strive to eliminate inactivity and shortcomings that affect the minds and lives of local people.
11: Continue to do good deeds, serve the people wholeheartedly to increase the trust, confidence and warmth of the people on the Royal Government.
