Responding to a question from a group of journalists asking what are the challenges facing prisons today? "The big challenge is overcrowding," the prison spokesman said.
"This overcrowding is not just a separate issue, it is causing other problems that make the unit face and face the challenges that we need to find a solution, so we need to be prepared," he said. "Strategic plan in accordance with the actual situation."
