Ms. Vuth Sopheakna added that this year marks the 10th anniversary of the establishment of the Confucius Institute at the Royal Academy of Cambodia. For the past 10 years, the Institute has been strongly committed to strengthening language and cultural exchanges, sharing experiences and trying to promote friendship between Cambodia and China in order to achieve mutual benefits.
She added that through this Chinese language program, you can continue your dreams, expand your knowledge, and achieve your dreams to help build our nation in the future. I would also like to confirm that the candidates who will win today will represent Cambodia to continue to compete with candidates from around the world.
