Samdech Krala Hos Kheng stated that on behalf of the Royal Government and on behalf of Samdech himself, I would like to express my congratulations, appreciation and high appreciation to the members of Svay Rieng Provincial Council who are represented by the people, the Commune / Sangkat Councilors who are The electorate voted to give confidence to continue to lead the province to grow in all areas.
