Ratanakkiri Police Detain 3 Suspects in Drug Trafficking Case
(Ratanakkiri): With the guidance of Major General Yin Chamnan, Provincial Police Commissioner and Brigadier General Van Sangvat, Deputy Commissioner for Anti-Drug Planning, and with the coordination of Mr. Leang Ou, Deputy Prosecutor of the Provincial Court. Three male and female suspects were arrested in connection with drug trafficking and use cases.
