China-Cambodia Chamber of Commerce Establishes Dialogue Forum for Cambodian Chamber of Commerce to Discuss Current Situation of Cambodian Economy
(Phnom Penh): R&F Cambodia, in collaboration with the China-Cambodia Chamber of Commerce and other well-known enterprises in Cambodia, has established a Dialogue Forum for the Cambodian Business Alliance for its current comfort and future progress. Cambodian businessmen in win-win cooperation. This forum was held during the inauguration of R&F Cambodia Business Alliance.
The forum discussed the current state of the Cambodian economy and the potential for future progress. The event was attended by a large number of relevant managers of R&F Cambodia, a strategic partner of the Business Owners Alliance in Phnom Penh on June 15, 2019.
