In accordance with the request of the people, Mr. Thong Khon provided a school building in Taing Kork district, today the groundbreaking ceremony was officially held
(Kampong Thom): To meet the requests of local people who are in need of school buildings and to participate in the implementation of the policy of the Royal Government, Mr. Thong Khon, Chairman of the Baray and Tang Kork District, Kampong Thom Province. Provided a new school building to Otumpor Primary School located in Udompor Village, Sralao Commune, Taing Kork District.
On June 16, 2019, Mr. Thong Khon also presided over the groundbreaking ceremony for the groundbreaking ceremony at Otumpor Primary School, which was attended by nearly 400 government officials, law enforcement forces, local working groups, people, teachers and students. People. The school building has 6 rooms, the zinc roof will take about 7 months to build from June 16, 2019 to January 2020.
During the groundbreaking ceremony, Mr. Thong Khon mentioned that the budget for the construction of the new school building was donated by philanthropists.
