(Phnom Penh): A man was arrested by the new Phnom Penh Administrative Post of the Sen Sok District Police Inspectorate after he used the trick of stealing more than $ 23,000 from the company he was working for at Med Farm. No. 60, Street 1, Onha Veang Village, Sangkat Phnom Penh Thmey, Khan Sen Sok.
