Authorities confirmed that prior to the incident, the suspect had been working in the above company to receive medical sales since 2016 and collected money from customers to pay the company a total of $ 23,503.34, but the suspect could not. Do not use the money collected to pay the company.
On June 3, 2019, the company claimed that the suspect had collected money from customers and did not hand it over to the company until June 15, 2019. The victim took the suspect and handed him over to the Phnom Penh Thmey Administration Post to work. After questioning, the victim filed a complaint against the suspect. The suspect is currently being held at the Sen Sok police station to follow procedures.
