The joint desire to see the growth of trade between Cambodia and Turkey was expressed in a bilateral working meeting between Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Erdogan in Tajikistan, where the two leaders attended the summit. The 5th Asia Interaction and Confidence Building Conference on the afternoon of June 15, 2019.
In order to boost the trade volume between the two countries to achieve this desire, Samdech Techo Prime Minister proposed to prepare a list of goods that can be exported between the two countries, that is, what goods Cambodia can export to Turkey. What goods can Turkey bring to Cambodia?
In particular, the Turkish President proposed the idea to encourage more Turkish and Cambodian investors and businessmen to do business together.
