The Turkish president said that Turkey now values cooperation with ASEAN and Turkey wants to become a sectoral dialogue partner with ASEAN into a comprehensive dialogue partner. To this request, the Prime Minister expressed his support and promised to work with other ASEAN member countries to support the promotion of Turkey's partnership with ASEAN.
