(Phnom Penh): The Acting Minister of Labor and Vocational Training, Mr. Pich Sophoan, said at the opening ceremony of the second National Day of Technical and Vocational Education and Training (TVET Day) that the development of new technologies during the Industrial Revolution. This will cause some job losses but also create new jobs that require all citizens to have technical and professional skills.
In this program, there is a big sponsorship from Cellcard, the only Cambodian company that always supports the program to continue to improve the education and vocational training.
