How will China and the US resolve bilateral trade disputes? Could Cambodia be affected by the Sino-US trade dispute?
I am happy to clarify some of the following:
China has a saying, "Something should not be done more than three times." This is clear proof! The United States is the real instigator of the Sino-US trade dispute, a real "traitor", a real "stumbling block", responsible for serious obstacles to Sino-US trade talks On the whole of America.
The first is the impact on the role of the multilateral trading system. The United States, under its own law, launches unilateral investigations into other countries and takes action to raise tariffs on them, seriously violating the relevant WTO conditions and leading to a multilateral trading system and manner. International trade regulation faces serious threats.
The second is the impact on the momentum of global economic growth. The United States continues to escalate trade disputes and raise tariffs, pushing the countries concerned with no choice but to retaliate, disrupting world trade and hampering global economic recovery. Let the world economy fall into the "trap of regression."
3. China adheres to the principle of "equality, mutual benefit and truth" as the right choice for resolving China-US trade disputes. How to resolve Sino-US trade disputes? China's attitude is clear and unwavering, that is, to achieve "two absolute points."
The first is to absolutely respect each other and benefit equally, respect the social system, economic system, development path and rights of both parties, respect the core interests and important issues of the partners in order to reach the final agreement. Mutual benefit and mutual success, and can not take the development rights of one side as a sacrifice, even more can not affect the sovereignty of any country.
Second, it is imperative to walk towards a common goal with a fundamental truth, both parties must understand each other and work together with a fundamental truth and must honor their promises. When an agreement is reached, it must be implemented with real care and from all angles, without changing the position and constantly changing the words. China continues to believe that trade wars have no winners, negotiations are the right way to go.
For the intentional trade war of the United States, China will not be afraid of any pressure, although we are not happy to attack, but we are not afraid to fight back, in the necessary stages, we will have no choice but to Retaliation. If we want to negotiate, we open the door to welcome, but if we want to strike, we will accompany us to the end.
