First, on behalf of the Sihanoukville Provincial Board of Governors, we are committed to respecting the Constitution, laws, regulations in force, and implementing the third phase of the Rectangular Strategic Policy and the political program of the Royal Government of the sixth mandate.
Second, strive to strengthen the provincial unity administration to make this administration more authoritative in managing functions and financial resources, personnel, assets, coordinating effectively, transparently, and accountable to the Royal Government and the people in its jurisdiction.
