The Governor of Phnom Penh considered the organization of public forums as an effective way to meet directly with the people and be aware of the new needs of the people who want the authorities to help solve.
The Governor of Phnom Penh also instructed the newly appointed Prek Pnov District Council to strengthen the internal unity in the Council and the Board of Governors, civil servants and competent forces at all levels on the basis of improving work efficiency. Obedience to state laws and principles.
Promoting the responsibility and ownership of officials in fulfilling their duties and responsibilities aimed at local development and responding to the needs of the people is to achieve the basic goals of development and better living standards of the people. Order.
Please note that Mr. Mao Bora has been appointed Chairman of the Prek Pnov District Council, accompanied by 17 members.
