At 3:00 a.m. on the same day, the police found the two suspects, including the motorcycle that was riding in the spare activity, locked another motorcycle at the back of Doeum Kralanh Market. The police immediately chased after the people. The suspect behind them frightened them and fled and dropped one of their accomplices in front of the New York school in Taphul village, Svay Dangkum commune, and changed their clothes to deceive the authorities and then escaped.
After that, the criminal police force of Siem Reap City went to bring the two suspects. Second name: Chea Raksmey, 20 years old, unreliable occupation, born in Touk Meas village, Ta Ong commune, Chamkar Leu district, Kampong Cham province.
