By signing the agreement today, it is expected to further increase the trade volume between the two countries, while the current trade volume is still small, from 2013 to mid-2018. The Cambodia-Hungary bilateral relationship is just over 16 million US dollars. Cambodia exported 13 million US dollars to Hungary and imported more than 3 million US dollars.
