Husband kills wife and then stabs himself in the back due to jealousy in Battambang
(Battambang): A man quarreled with his wife because of jealousy, cut his wife, causing serious injuries, and was sent to the hospital by a neighbor, while the husband thought his wife was dead, so he returned home to borrow a knife Kill yourself later. This incident happened on the evening of June 13, 2019 at house number 196, group 13, Damnak Luong village, Wat Kor commune, Battambang city, Battambang province.
Brigadier General Chet Vanny, Deputy Provincial Police Commissioner for Criminal Planning, said that the perpetrator, 28-year-old Rat Chetra, had violently attacked his wife, 27-year-old Sok Lin, causing serious injuries. He was rushed to the 5th Military Hospital (P2) while the husband, who thought his wife was dead, ran to the neighbor's house to borrow a knife and then hanged himself.
According to witness Kong Sothearin, a 47-year-old man, on the evening of June 13, 2019, while sitting in front of his house drinking beer with his relatives, Rat Chetra came to his house and borrowed it. Knife and asked what to do with the knife, then the perpetrator told to make a phone, he walked near the stairs and suddenly hanged himself to death.
