3 Suspects Arrested in Pursat Economic Land Concession Violation Case
(Pursat): Three suspects were actually arrested on the orders of the Pursat Provincial Prosecutor in the case of encroachment on state land with economic concessions to Pheapimex Cassava Development Company. The above transaction took place on June 12, 2019 at Koh Ta Nhung in Dambok 100 village, Thnaot Chum commune, Krakor district, Pursat province.
According to the report, the three suspects were actually detained on the land, according to the case of Mr. Ton Siha Techak, Prosecutor of Pursat Provincial Court.
The three suspects are currently being held at the Krakor District Police Inspectorate for further investigation. For the confiscated items, there is a bulldozer that is plowing and planting mangoes, and a 2019 black 125cc motorcycle with license plate number Pursat 1I-4313 kept at the Krakor District Police Inspectorate.
Lt. Gen. Hun Manet was warmly welcomed by the Minister of Defense of Singapore during his visit.
