The inauguration ceremony of Ou Raing Ov District Council was also attended by Mr. Seak Leng, Chairman of the Provincial Council, as well as many newly elected councilors.
The four points mentioned in the plan are: 1: Continue to implement the joint work better, 2: Continue the internal unity as a whole, 3: Continue to solve the concerns of the people effectively and Fourth: To work together to ensure that the Orang Ov district administration achieves new results.
In addition, Mr. Cheam Chansophoan expressed his congratulations, appreciation and high appreciation to the members of Ou Raing Ov District, Tbong Khmum Province, who were represented by the people, the members of the Commune / Sangkat Council, voted to continue to lead the district administration to continue to grow. All sectors must strive to serve the interests and needs of all people equally, transparently, fairly and without political bias.
