* By 2020: Decide that at least 50% of tourism professionals must have a certificate or certification, must have a certificate or certification in accordance with national and ASEAN standards through training and competency assessment as of 2018 among staff Of the total 620,000 people in the tourism industry, only 40% are capable of meeting ASEAN standards.
* By 2025: Out of more than 1.2 million tourism professionals, 100% of professionals must have a certificate or certification in line with national and ASEAN standards through training and competency assessment. ASEAN.
