The official confirmed that the Vietnamese man, Nguyen Tieng, 47, was born in Chau Chan district, Hoang province, Vietnam, and came to Cambodia in 1990 through a pottery factory to seek compensation.
After the current interrogation, the specialized force of the Office of Investigation and Procedure of the Kampong Cham Provincial Police has prepared a case to send the above Vietnamese nationals to the General Department of Immigration to proceed with the procedure.
(Phnom Penh): From the beginning of the year from January to June 2019, the number of dengue cases has increased more than four times higher than in 2018, with about 9,000 cases of dengue fever and 15 deaths. This was confirmed by Dr. Huy Rekul, Director of the Center for Malaria, Parasitology and Bacteriology.
