Second: Complete name correction
* Attach a provisional certificate of lower secondary education, general education and complete education (original) copy of birth certificate or birth certificate or a copy of birth certificate or a copy of birth certificate (a copy of the original certificate) By the principal)
* Attach a copy of the court decision or verdict to be corrected or certified as a single person (a copy has a legalization).
Please note that "the application for correction must be made before the deadline for the application for registration for the high school diploma exam every year and does not require the applicant to pay a service fee. Widespread in their respective educational institutions.
17 drug suspects at LUX Sary nightclub sent to court
(Phnom Penh): A group of 17 men and women who were detained by the police in the operation to crack down on drugs at the nightclub brand "Lux Sary" recently sent to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court this morning. June 12, 2019 to take legal action.
The 17 people involved in the court are five Vietnamese and 10 Cambodians. During the operation, authorities also detained 31 other foreigners, but they were sent to the General Department of Foreign Affairs. In addition, other drug addicts are sent to drug rehabilitation centers.
Please be reminded that the search operation of the above entertainment club took place at 4:00 AM on June 08, 2019, along Street 214, corner of Street 63, Sangkat Boeung Reang, Khan Daun Penh. After the search, the police closed the club temporarily and brought about 400 players to the Phnom Penh Police.
The search of the Lux Sary nightclub took place just days after a man entered the club and a gunshot wound injured a woman in the thigh.
