(Koh Kong): Mrs. Mithona Phu Thong, Governor of Koh Kong Province, visited and distributed land titles, which are land concessions from the Royal Government to 184 families living in Prek Smach and Peam Kay villages, Koh Sdach commune, Kirisakor district, Koh Kong province.
