(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology has issued a warning on Cambodia's weather from today to June 18, 2019 that during this period, the low pressure valley continues to extend over Cambodia as the southwest monsoon increases. Influence on coastal areas such as:
1: From 12 to 18 June, heavy rain continues to fall across the country.
2. Provinces in the coastal areas of the central lowlands in the east of Vietnam receive moderate to moderate rainfall. Meanwhile, some places may have large quantities.
3: The provinces in the northwest also increased from mild to moderate and scattered better than in the past.
4: In the upper northeastern provinces bordering Vietnam, the rainfall will be light to moderate.
5: Thunderstorms, wind gusts continue to occur while on the sea surface from 12 to 13 June, the sky is cloudy, mixed with rain, strong winds and high waves.
