(Banteay Meanchey): After the hasty construction efforts, 82 houses donated by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross were handed over to veterans. Cambodia in Banteay Meanchey while more than 200 houses are under construction.
