Hak Sophoeun, Apsara TV Information Department, Dies
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Hak Sophoeun, an employee of the Information Department of Apsara National Radio and Television, passed away at 6:30 pm on June 11, 2019 at the Khmer-Soviet Friendship Hospital. At the age of 50 due to illness.
In the face of this death, the management and staff of all Apsara radio and television stations are deeply saddened by the loss of valuable human resources to serve the motherland, this loss can not meet forever.
The unexpected loss of Hak Sophoeun now is the loss of an employee, the loss of a husband, the loss of a good father.
The leaders of Apsara Radio and Television would like to express our deepest condolences to the families of the deceased, relatives and all the children and dedicate our prayers to the soul of Mr. Hak Sophoeun.
