(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Capital Administration has issued a notification on the measurement and demarcation of Choeung Ek Lake in Khan Meanchey and Khan Dangkor, Phnom Penh. This is according to the announcement of Phnom Penh Capital Administration, which was received by Fresh News on June 11, 2019.
