* First: Search for the 190-hectare border point to be reserved for development and find the occupant border point of 190 hectares to be reserved for development * Second: Search for the border point of Choeung Eang Lake area 181 hectares to be kept as public property of the state * Third: Study and measure to determine the standard network of infrastructure to the location of Boeung Choeung Ek.
