(Phnom Penh): China is a country with a population of about 1.4 billion people, and there is a great demand for fruits to supply the population, while a Cambodian agricultural exporter claims that Cambodia should catch Take this opportunity and try to cultivate more to export to China, which is in great demand.
In the "Special Guest of the Week" program, Mr. Nong Veasna, Vice President of the Cambodian Rice Federation and an exporter of agricultural products, said that China is a country where people like to eat fruit, while every year China imports fruits. In the amount of billions of dollars.
Mr. Veasna said that in addition to rice, there are many products that Cambodian farmers are producing and exporting to China at high prices.
Mr. Nong Veasna said that mango is a product that Cambodian farmers can grow anywhere and taste different from neighboring countries due to the hot climate and acidic soil, and China is a country that uses mangoes. On a large scale.
At the same time, the agricultural exporter added that China prefers to eat fruits, especially lentils, while China imports billions of dollars a year. And the new fruits that are popular in China are mangosteen and durian. In addition, there are many other agricultural products such as avocado.
Please be informed that currently, six kinds of Cambodian agricultural products are allowed to be exported directly by the Chinese side: rice, corn, dried cassava, cashew, rice and banana.
Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries Veng Sakhon has stated that Cambodia is preparing to hold talks with the Chinese side to achieve the signing of a joint protocol on the export of mangoes, dragon fruit and dragon saliva. Direct to China.
