Nationwide Traffic Law Enforcement Campaign on June 9: 301 illegal vehicles were found and 188 fines were imposed.
(Phnom Penh): Nationwide Traffic Law Enforcement Campaign For June 9, 2019, the traffic police force inspected 1,793 vehicles and found 301 vehicles violating the law (64% motorcycles), 113 education vehicles and 188 fines. Units, according to the official report of the General Commission of the National Police.
According to the report, 1,082 helmets and goggles were inspected on June 9, 66 education helmets and 128 helmets were fined.
