Separately, for 18 children in serious emergency, each received 1 kit and 100,000 Riels. As for the guardians who stay with each other, they receive 20,000 Riels.
Please note that on the same day, the Cambodian Red Cross branch in Siem Reap also donated $ 35,000 to Angkor Hospital for Children.
