(Pailin): On June 08, 2019, Mr. Phan Chanthul, Governor of Pailin Province, accompanied by Ms. Chea Leap, Deputy Governor, and the leaders of government officials, departments, units around the province, opened the construction site of a concrete road to the commune hall. Stung Karch, Sala Krao district, to facilitate travel in and out of providing public services to citizens in accordance with the policy of deep reform of the Royal Government.
Mr. Phan Chanthul stated that the Royal Government of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen has worked hard to solve all the difficulties and requests of the people as well as to build the nation to develop in all areas, especially Construction of physical infrastructure such as: roads, bridges, schools, hospitals, etc.
