Minister of Health: All ministry officials are ready to check and treat if there are cases of poisoning, diarrhea, vomiting when eating noodles tomorrow
(Phnom Penh): The Minister of Health, Professor Mam Bunheng, said that all our officials are ready to help treat our people if there is any case of poisoning by eating vegetables. Fruit or noodles tomorrow.
Minister Mam Bunheng said that on June 9, 2019, tomorrow, people all over the country will eat noodles, please keep clean, especially vegetables, and if you have diarrhea, please come to our hospital to get ready. 24-hour treatment. In addition, he said that we always pay attention, because we have to eat daily, so you have to adhere to hygiene.
"Tomorrow we eat noodles, we think about how to make a lot of noodles, so how to clean the water, wash the noodles and vegetables must be washed clean."
The Minister of Health continued, "I understand that in Phnom Penh, there is not much of a problem because most of their noodle production is in the water industry, but it is feared that in the countryside it is not as hygienic as the vegetables that are not washed properly." "Drugs are a problem, so we have to be careful."
In addition, "we will always be ready to continue to make you happy and ready to help you with diarrhea." But we are ready to help you if you have diarrhea or vomiting, we are always ready to help him. We bless our brothers and sisters to eat happily and without any problems.
Please be informed that the statement of the Minister of Health was made on the occasion of leading a group of volunteer doctors to visit and treat nearly 1,000 people for free in Borey 100 village, Sangkat Teuk Thla, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh. 7 union leaders apply for intervention from Labor Minister after Chimisin boss fired
