According to the US administration, the reason behind the disagreement between the two sides was that the Chinese side revised the agreement, which was contrary to previous agreements. But in fact, the reason why China revised the agreement was because China could not do what the United States wanted too much and from the United States itself miscalculated, as well as underestimated the trade war of its own. You cause.
* Was the United States the culprit in the trade war?
The rewrite of the deal will give Beijing the power to change what the United States wants from China, while Huawei will be blacklisted by Washington. The mistakes of the Donald Trump administration in the trade war may be due to their desire to win too soon before the 2020 US presidential election, forgetting that China also has big weapons for Make a trade war.
The weapons that China could use with the United States include raising tariffs on agricultural products, passenger planes, and more importantly, China is the largest creditor of the United States.
* China uses tolerance policy
Despite the escalating trade war with the United States, China has always shown greater tolerance by taking retaliatory measures smaller than Washington. Why did China decide to do so? This may mean that China wants to survey the US reaction and predict future effects, or in other words, a tolerant strategy can help China see the benefits directly and indirectly.
The direct interests are to support economic growth, development, protection of social stability, and the indirect benefit is to prevent any impact on the global market, which could raise China's profile on the international stage.
US President Donald Trump on Wednesday threatened to raise $ 300 billion in tariffs on more Chinese imports. But he also hinted that China is likely to seek a solution with the United States over the heated trade dispute, and that Donald Trump wants China to negotiate because the United States itself is suffering. The danger is almost non-existent due to over-desire to defeat China.
