In order to use the common name in Khmer of the pesticides on crops in Cambodia to be consistent, effective and efficient in the field of crop protection, the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries would like to advise the subordinate units and all stakeholders to pay attention to implementation. The following measures:
1. The Department of Agricultural Legislation shall cooperate with the General Department of Agriculture by using the Glossary of Crops in Khmer as a reference in the use of the common name in Khmer of the Pesticides on pesticide information labels registered with the Ministry of Agriculture and Forestry. Hunting and fishing are licensed for import and distribution in Cambodia.
3. Companies importing and distributing pesticides in Cambodia must use the common name in Khmer of the composition of pesticides, according to the Glossary of Contaminants on crops in Khmer to prepare all technical documents, promotional materials and other relevant documents.
