The Minister of Economy of Cambodia thanked the Swiss government for its continued support and assistance to the operation of Kantha Bopha Hospital for the next four years.
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Economy and Finance, met with Mr. Ivo Sieber, Ambassador of the Swiss Confederation to Cambodia as His Excellency Ambassador ended his diplomatic mission in Phnom Penh. Cambodia. The meeting was held on June 6, 2019 at the Ministry of Economy and Finance.
Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth expressed his appreciation and appreciation for the achievements of both Ivo Sieber and his physical and mental efforts during his diplomatic mission in Cambodia. Cambodia-Switzerland bilateral operations are stronger and deeper, especially trade, economic and development cooperation in Cambodia.
The Deputy Prime Minister also thanked the Swiss Government for its continued support and assistance to the operation of Kantha Bopha Hospital, which, through the Swiss Agency for Development and Cooperation, has pledged continued financial support to the Department. Doctor for the next 4 years.
At the same time, the General Doctor emphasized that the Royal Government of Cambodia has also made great efforts to support the operation of this hospital by establishing the "Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia" under the initiative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia. Mobilize resources to ensure the sustainability of the operation of Kantha Bopha Hospital in Cambodia.
Mr. Ivo Sieber expressed his deep gratitude to the relevant Cambodian Ministries and Institutions for their excellent cooperation, which has led to the great success of his diplomatic mission over the past four years in Cambodia.
The Ambassador saw the steady growth of Cambodia today with strong economic growth resulting from the reform efforts of all sectors and the pragmatic leadership of the Royal Government of Cambodia. With a lot of work experience in Cambodia, he still feels close to Cambodia.
During the meeting, the two sides agreed to promote investment and expand trade between the two countries by encouraging Swiss investors to invest in Cambodia with confidence. And is creating a favorable business environment for all foreign investors and strive to reform in all areas to build better competition.
Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth wished Ivo Sieber success in his new role and affirmed that the Ministry of Economy and Finance will continue to maintain good relations with the new Ambassador of the Swiss Confederation, promoting cooperation and friendship. To be more close for the benefit of the country and the people of both countries, Cambodia-Switzerland.
