(Phnom Penh): France's Foreign Trade Advisory Group held its first ASEAN Forum in Phnom Penh for two days from June 6 and 7, 2019 with more than 180 participants.
Businessmen and executives who are investing in one or more ASEAN countries with an interest in the ASEAN region have exchanged views on opportunities for French companies, as well as current and future strategies and perspectives.
