He met with Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, to discuss relations between the two countries.
Entrepreneurs and French ambassadors to ASEAN countries gathered on Thursday night, June 6, at the French Embassy for a banquet hosted by Minister of Commerce Pan Sosak.
The above events reflect the importance of the political and economic partnership between France and Cambodia and will contribute to further strengthening the partnership in the future.
