(Phnom Penh): In order to strengthen the protection of the welfare of the people, as well as in addition to the regular work of inspecting goods in the market every day on June 7, 2019, Camcontrol Phnom Penh International Port in cooperation with officials of the Department of Commerce to inspect Examine food products in major markets in Chbar Ampov district, focusing on noodles and vegetables.
