By receiving money from abroad, some activists of the former opposition party, such as in Battambang province named Rozet, etc. Attempted to re-establish its network in the country to carry out political action against the Supreme Court ruling on the orders of Sam Rainsy from abroad.
But after the secret plan was broken up, the group turned the noodle story into a political one. They turned the blame on the authorities, accusing them of just eating noodles and calling for questioning. In fact, we also know that eating noodles, pastries or eggs, etc.
It does not matter, but the problem is that as long as people commit illegal acts, the law will deal with them. If the law governs when you are eating any food, we can not tie this to the food, because the food is not wrong, as in the case of noodles.
But this noodle trick is actually a dangerous corrupt political game that is only covered up by noodles. After the split, former opposition leaders inflated the issue of eating noodles into a bigger political issue by calling on their supporters to eat noodles on June 9.
This call is the most poisonous political message of Sam Rainsy because:
First, it makes sellers and noodle lovers feel awkward because they seem to be politically colored because of the activity of selling or eating noodles.
Second, it is a political message that divides the whole Cambodian society because there is a division between those who eat noodles and those who do not eat noodles. And when it comes to CPP supporters, they no longer dare to eat noodles, while supporters of other parties or centrists also refrain from eating noodles for fear of the former opposition party including them as their own. Also.
Third, it makes Noodles, the Khmer identity, a complete political hostage. This is Sam Rainsy's worst corrupt politics.
Seeing the great danger to Cambodian society and national identity, Prime Minister Hun Sen decided to dismantle Sam Rainsy's wicked plan again. This evil plan is really deep, but I think it is a superficial trick in the eyes of Prime Minister Hun Sen, who is full of old experience. Most effective.
Prime Minister Hun Sen has announced that everyone will eat noodles and set June 9, 2019 as the day for the preparation of noodles nationwide, the same day that the former opposition leader set his group to eat noodles.
Another important message of Prime Minister Hun Sen is "National Unity Noodles". This message completely neutralized the poison of Sam Rainsy's "separatist noodles". Nowadays, every Cambodian can eat noodles with pride and openness, regardless of party affiliation. They not only eat normally, but also post pictures on Facebook.
Therefore, Samdech Techo Hun Sen's trick to disintegrate the poison of "political noodles" or "separatist noodles" of Sam Rainsy really works faster than 5G internet, that is, this trick turned Sam Rainsy's separatist poison into honey Sweet and delicious for national reconciliation:
First, the transformation of making noodle sellers and noodle eaters feel uncomfortable by being painted as a proud noodle seller and eater and selling better than before.
Second: Transforming the poison of noodles into national honey into the honey of reconciliation and national unity, because from now on, Khmer noodles have no political color.
Third: The trick of pushing the boat along the water of Prime Minister Hun Sen freed the noodles, the Khmer identity from the hostage of Sam Rainsy's poison completely.
I noticed that after the announcement of Prime Minister Hun Sen, Khmer noodles are now being underestimated and not in demand. This is the meaning of the story of the noodles that I would like to explain to the Cambodian people all over the country to understand, because some people may not yet understand this deep meaning.
That is why some of Sam Rainsy's supporters, including some who claim to be intellectuals, have sent a message that does not understand the meaning that Prime Minister Hun Sen talks about noodles is following him. Sam Rainsy.
But I think our country is very lucky to have Prime Minister Hun Sen as the head of the country, why our country does not know how to fall because of all the tricks and all the images of Sam Rainsy, even Noodles can also be drawn into politics.
