Telecommunication Infrastructure Service Provider Plants 500 Saplings in Kampong Speu Province
(Phnom Penh): IDC Cambodia, a leading provider of telecommunications infrastructure services in Cambodia, has launched an initiative under the program Towards a Green World, its social program in Cambodia. This program took place in Kampong Speu province on June 1, 2019.
The main goal of this program is to plant 500 saplings with the active participation of the community and to increase awareness of the benefits of replanting trees, at the same time to create There is a good atmosphere in the community and better relations with local authorities. In addition, the company also distributed some essential items to 50 families living in the community.
The Towards a Greener World Program is one of IEDCO's key sustainability initiatives, divided into two core areas: community empowerment and environmental responsibility. These are linked to the United Nations Development Goals for 2030 (SDGs) and these two bases have been successfully implemented in other environmental programs in Bangladesh and Malaysia, which are now Cambodia's turn.
IDC is confident that in the future there will be a sustainable, environmentally friendly environment with potential resources in the community. The planting of this tree represents a meaningful effort to improve the quality of the environment as well as the livelihood of the people in the community in Kampong Speu province.
"This program is organized and collaborated by community leaders and local villagers. The purpose of this program is to contribute to the government's strategy of trying to protect the environment to prevent resilience to natural disasters," he said. "As well as together to create a beautiful and bright environment for future generations."
The program also included speeches by Mr. Phillip Wong and the Governor of Oral District, followed by a tree planting program attended by staff from ITC, business partners, students from the Student and Community Development Institute.
In building and building sustainable connectivity for the future, IDC is playing a key role in providing world-class telecommunication infrastructure services and solutions in line with the wider community and environment.
