The objectives of the meeting were: * First, to improve road traffic safety for the transportation of passengers and goods. * Second, to discuss and find solutions to challenges to prevent and reduce traffic accidents for the transport sector. Transportation of passengers and goods. * Third: Link closer communication between the Traffic Police and Public Order Department with associations and transport companies and freight teams.
The director of the department confirmed that in the first five months of 2019, despite the increase in accidents to trucks, but observed that the number of deaths and injuries associated with the transport team has decreased significantly. Starting from the spirit of participation, respect for the rules of the company and the driver, driver management, regular inspection of vehicle specifications and careful driving, which can be an experience for further practice.
