(Phnom Penh): The body of a man was found floating in a hole in the ground, suspected to be part of three drug users who fled from the police while the police cracked down on drug users and ran into the water two days ago.
The incident that caused the surprise card after the local people found the body floating at 8 am on June 3, 2019 in Trapeang Chrey village, Sangkat Kakap 2, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
Long Nou, 27, a blacksmith, and his wife, Pet Khouch, 28, a factory worker, had a daughter living in a rented house in Kraing Ska village, Kraing Ska commune, Toul Phos district, Kampong Chhnang province.
According to sources at the scene, on the night of June 1, 2019, the victim, along with two other friends, got drunk and then rode a motorcycle to the ground. Field mouth pit above ground to smoke drugs.
While being patrolled by the police, the three of them ran away, but were immediately arrested by the police, while the man and the other man jumped into the water and jumped into the pit. During the crackdown, police fired on the threat.
The source said that after several police forces went to surround the pit, but did not find the dead man and another faction could not get out of the water, then the police withdrew. On the morning of June 3, the body was found floating in the water. The other faction that ran into the water with the authorities has not been found yet.
Immediately, the competent experts went to the forensic examination and concluded that the victim really died from drowning, now the body has been handed over to the family for the traditional ceremony.
