According to eyewitnesses, while the victim was riding a black 2017 Marque 125 Serei on a steep road, a cement truck drove down the slope and hit the victim's motorbike. In a fit of rage, he dragged both the victim and the motorcycle into a construction site, completely damaging the car and motorcycle. The victim died trapped under the car at the scene.
