Samdech Techo Hun Sen added that by launching this social protection policy, pregnant women have come to check their health at public hospitals or health centers across the country free of charge. Received cash allowance for them, each of whom received 40,000 Riels, and the visit to receive medical services is checked four times before the day of delivery.
