The Minister made this request during a meeting with leaders and officials of the Department of Commerce and officials of the Camcontrol branch held in the meeting hall of the Department of Commerce of Battambang on the morning of June 3, 2019 to review View the progress of the Department of Commerce and share information on the latest developments related to trade in Cambodia and the world.
