(Preah Sihanouk): Lt. Gen. Dy Vichea, Deputy Commissioner General of the National Police and Director of the Central Department of Security Police, on June 1, 2019, paid a visit to the family of 10-year-old Pha Srey Leak. The perpetrator raped and severely abused 2-and-a-half-year-old boy Pha Sokly in Koki village, Bit Trang commune, Prey Nob district, Preah Sihanouk province.
In addition to re-encouraging the families of the young victims, Lt. Gen. Di Vichea confirmed that at this time, the relevant authorities are cooperating with the provincial commissioner and the specialized department to find the killer and punish him as strictly as possible in accordance with the law. Justice for the victims.
Please be informed that this murder is a case of rape and murder occurred on May 29, 2019, caused by a perpetrator who is suspected that the perpetrator may have raped a girl almost 10 years old, then killed both the girl and A child over 2 years old sleeping in the same house.
According to the police, the younger brother died immediately in the house, while the older sister was taken by her family to Phnom Penh, but could not save her life and died in the car at the time. 8 nights the same day. The victim was Pha Sokly and the older sister was Pha Srey Leak.
General Neth Savoeun, the National Police Commissioner General, has ordered the capital-provincial police forces to work together to catch the perpetrators of the killings of two siblings in Prey Nob district, Sihanoukville province.
