(Preah Sihanouk): Deputy Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province, Mr. Mang Sineth, handed over the precious assistance of Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross to the families of girls and boys who were brutally beaten to death. Koki village, Bit Trang commune, Prey Nob district, Preah Sihanouk province, on the evening of May 29, 2019.
