This environmental awareness program lasts for 7 months, starting from November 2018 and ending on May 30, 2019.
The program encourages students to change their attitudes to eliminate or reduce litter in schools. For the future, he hopes that all students and schools will have the independence to take care of the environment themselves and be able to teach other schools to understand the environment more broadly.
