The announcement of the support of the Prime Minister of Japan was made on May 31, 2019 on the occasion of his meeting and discussion with Samdech Techo Hun Sen. According to Mr. Kao Kim Hourn, "The Prime Minister of Japan said that he welcomed the Japanese investment in Cambodia. He welcomed the measures taken by Samdech Techo Hun Sen to reduce costs and create a favorable environment for business in Cambodia.
