According to the report, 2,199 helmets and goggles were inspected on May 30, 166 education helmets and 364 glasses were fined.
For the results of the 30-day inspection from May 1 to 30, 2019, the police inspected 94,522 vehicles and found 18,478 offending vehicles (74% motorcycles), including education 6,342 units and 12,136 fines. Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth announced the implementation of three strategies to reform the sub-national budget system, public procurement system and national revenue collection.
