Japanese company Minibia announces 7,000 street lights in Phnom Penh and Siem Reap (Tokyo, Japan): Japanese company Minibia, a Cambodian fashion manufacturer, has announced 7,000 street lamps. In Phnom Penh and Siem Reap. In Phnom Penh, 5,000 bulbs and in Siem Reap, 2,000 bulbs.
