At the same time, Mr. Yoshihi Sakai Numa also informed the Prime Minister about the company's contribution to the national football of Cambodia for two years. He also claimed that his company, which is successful in Cambodia, will continue to expand its investment.
In response, the Prime Minister also thanked Minneapolis for helping Cambodia. Samdech Techo Prime Minister also advised the company to continue to help install this lamp in other provinces.
Because Minibia has contributed to the training of human resources in Cambodia, Samdech Techo also advised the company to continue to help develop human resources in Cambodia.
