Strong wind destroys the houses of 79 families in Kang Meas district, Kampong Cham province, Samdech Kittipritthbandit's gift must be distributed immediately
(Kampong Cham): The Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, on the morning of May 30, 2019, led a team to distribute donations from Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross to distribute to 79 families affected by the wind. House collapse and roof collapse in Reay Pay commune, Kang Meas district, Kampong Cham province.
