Preah Sihanouk Provincial Commissioner announces the arrest of the murderer of two children to give justice to the victim's family, he and his wife paid for the funeral and coffin
(Preah Sihanouk): Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police Commissioner, Major General Chuon Narin, promised with the families of two young victims who were raped and killed that he would cooperate with the relevant authorities to arrest them. The perpetrators are punished in the strictest way to give justice to the victims.
