(Ratanakkiri): The Governor of Ratanakkiri Province, Mr. Thong Savun, on May 30, 2019, called on all stakeholders to support, promote and protect children, who are the pillars of the nation. Mr. Thong Savun's appeal was made on the occasion of presiding over the 70th anniversary of International Children's Day on June 1, which was held at Samdech Ov Samdech Mey High School in Ratanakkiri Province.
The provincial governor continued that all relevant institutions, professional units, local authorities at all levels, the private sector, non-governmental organizations, as well as citizens of all walks of life, would like to support and promote children who are the pillars of the nation to ensure Growing up physically, intellectually and mentally aims to become good children, good students and good citizens of our society.
