(Preah Sihanouk): The most tragic story for a family in Koki village, Bit Trang commune, Prey Nob district, Preah Sihanouk province, with two young children, a brother and a sister, just 10 and a half years old, died on suspicion It is a rape and murder. This brutal incident happened on the evening of May 29, 2019.
The nearly half-minute video shows the father screaming as he ran to hug his two sons and daughters, who were raped and killed in the house.
Prey Nup district police officials said the murder was suspected to be a rape-murder case committed by an unidentified perpetrator. It is suspected that the perpetrator raped a 10-year-old girl and then killed both her and her two-and-a-half-year-old sister who were sleeping in the same house.
Police said that the younger brother died immediately in the house, the older sister was rescued by the family to Phnom Penh, but could not save lives and died in the car at the time. 8 nights the same day.
The victim was Pha Sokly, 2 and a half years old, and his older sister was Pha Srey Leak, 10 years old.
In this case, Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Chuon Narin confirmed this morning that his police force cooperated with the specialized department to bring the perpetrators to justice.
What made them very sad was that the father, when he came to see this incident, he was immediately shocked, cried and felt sorry for his son.
