As a coffee table observer, I have been noticing this remarkable change of mindset for weeks.
Currently, Cambodians have learned about world issues and seen the future of Cambodia as follows:
First, maintaining peace and political stability in the country is the most important thing for all countries, especially Cambodia, because peace and political stability are the foundation for the development of the national economy as well as the family economy to make the country stronger and more viable. Be yourself and go to reduce dependence on foreigners.
Fourth, the development of the country in the current era of modern technology requires the intelligence and flexibility of politicians and leaders to benefit the country and its people, especially in the context of the trade war between the great powers.
On the contrary, the Cambodian people have expressed their frustration with a group of politicians who are acting in the guise of bandits, who daily think only of inciting aggression, causing society to fall into chaos again. Governments are seeking benefits for nations and peoples from all parts of the world.
Contradictory actions between the government and the rebel politicians have been shining a light on the hearts of all Cambodians to see more clearly who is trying to maintain peace, political stability and the development of the country, and who is trying. Destroy.
In general, the Cambodian people are now clearer and more recognizable of politicians, and they are firmly on the side of defending and building, completely rejecting those who are trying to destroy the peace of the nation. . This is a new mindset of the Cambodian people that politicians can not overlook. Those who ignore and reverse this trend will surely suffer bitterly and shamefully.
