(Siem Reap): A four-and-a-half-year-old police officer at the Ministry of Interior was arrested by Siem Reap provincial police in accordance with an arrest warrant issued by the Siem Reap Provincial Court in connection with a drug trafficking case that his party confessed to authorities.
