It should be noted that the arrest of this police officer came after the Siem Reap City Police arrested two suspects in connection with a drug case in front of Wat Preah Indokosey, Traing Village, Slor Kram Sangkat and in a rented room. Location: Sala Kanseng Village, Sangkat Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap City.
The two suspects, Sroeun Virak, born in 1993, and Duong Sam Oeun, alias Mab, born in 1994, were sent to Siem Reap Provincial Court for legal action.
