(Phnom Penh): The Khmer Breweries Company, which produces Cambodian beer, welcomes national and international guests to visit the production line of beer and beverage products, and here are five reasons why the public should visit this modern factory:
1: Khmer Breweries is the only real Cambodian-invested factory in Cambodia that produces both beer and beverages using the latest machines and technology. The public will gain in-depth knowledge of the production line, quality of ingredients and modern packaging of Cambodian beer and all kinds of beverages, with expert guides in this field explain every step.
2: Visitors to the factory can have the opportunity to contribute to society by buying souvenirs sold in the factory, all the profits will be used to help develop the community.
3. Khmer Breweries also has a large and modern auditorium that can accommodate up to 300 people for the public to use free of charge for non-profit events.
4: In addition to focusing on modern machinery and technology that does not harm the environment, Khmer Breweries is changing the face of this large factory to be greener to increase the fresh and clean environment for staff as well as guests. Visit the factory.
5: Visitors to the factory will have the opportunity to taste fresh and cold Cambodian beer and other beverages of Khmer Breweries in a comfortable dining area and can enjoy various entertainment.
