Mr. Veng Sakhon said that becoming a full member of the International Network for Bamboo and Rattan requires a formal decision from the government through the submission of ratification documents. In particular, Cambodia, as well as other countries that have not yet submitted the ratification document of this ratification, can only attend the meeting by invitation as an observer.
