Mr. Lam Kim Leng, Director General of the General Department of Small and Medium Enterprises and Handicrafts, confirmed that Cambodia has more than 5,000 hectares of salt production area. Two provinces, Kampot and Kep, are producing salt with more than 10 constituencies and nearly 200 solidarity groups.
