The system of transfer and opening cash and can select Wing Specialized Bank as a cash transfer transaction agent with more than 6,000 branches nationwide. Wing Specialized Bank will set up an account and card making for each woman with a clear user ID, can be used anywhere and has a term of five years, and the approved cash and the beneficiary can withdraw or keep in Individual accounts.
