This election will take place from Thursday to Sunday across the 28 member states of the European Parliament, and the election in the Netherlands is the most important because it is rich in people. Anti-EU policies and immigration.
People across Europe will vote for 751 MPs, but that number will be reduced to 705 when the UK leaves the EU. Britain has 73 members in the European Parliament and will lose their jobs when their country officially divorces the EU.
