Mr. Suy Sem, Minister of Mines and Energy and Mr. Keo Rattanak, Deputy Prime Minister in charge of Electricite du Cambodge (EDC) will lead their professional officers to the Supreme Advisory Council.
According to Mr. Chhim Phal Varun, Secretary General of the Supreme Advisory Council, 49 members from the Ministry of Mines and Energy and Electricity of Cambodia will take part in the discussion tomorrow.
