Beer and beverage experts from around the world will visit Khmer Breweries to learn about modern technology
(Phnom Penh): Khmer Breweries will host a visit from participants from more than 10 countries around the world to attend the Bangkok Brewery Workshop 2019 soon.
The participants are experts, researchers, suppliers as well as senior leaders in the beer and beverage industry from around the world.
The visit to Khmer Breweries will focus on the latest machinery and technology used in the production of Cambodian beer and other beverages by Khmer Breweries.
A visit to the Brewery and Beverage Factory is one of the activities of the three-day workshop where delegates will have the opportunity to visit directly from the brewery and beverage chain in Southeast Asia.
Khmer Breweries is the first truly local Cambodian factory to host a gathering of senior experts in the Cambodian beer and beverage industry. $ 000 in Kratie City
