17 young Cambodian students sent to study in Singapore for 7 days
(Phnom Penh): In order to contribute to the promotion of education in Cambodia by sending students to foreign countries that have progressed in the field of education, on May 22, 2019, the school "International Vision Cambodia" sent its students. 17 to attend a week-long study exchange in Singapore.
