"International True Vision Cambodia" School has developed a number of curricula, namely: National Curriculum and International Curriculum.
In addition, the international curriculum is in line with the curricula of the United States, the United Kingdom, Canada, New Zealand, Australia and Singapore, with a Memorandum of Understanding on program exchange. Student learning.
