(Central): Police in Angsnoul district launched an active drug trafficking operation in the area, arresting one drug trafficker while another was on the run and confiscating nearly 50 packages of drugs.
Lt. Gen. Thach Sovanna continued that the exhibits confiscated included: 49 packs of white crystalline powder suspected to be drugs, ice cubes, as well as a drug bag, drug packaging and some drug paraphernalia. .
By order of the Commissioner and coordinated by the Deputy Commissioner General of the Anti-Drug Crime Plan and approved by the Prosecutor of Kandal Provincial Court, with the participation of the village chief, the police station and in front of the people Suspect Sao Vichet, Special Forces, searched the house of suspect Sem Semal and found 49 packages of drugs in his handbag, backpack and drug paraphernalia.
According to the suspect's confession, Sao Vichet replied that on the day of the incident, he intended to buy drugs from Visal at the scene, when the police raided and escaped, but the police arrested the suspect In the past, he used to buy drugs under the name Visal often to use and used the name Visal to sell drugs once.
