(Phnom Penh): After arresting a drug trafficker for questioning, hours later, the Russey Keo district police force has been searching for the remaining sources and factions to continue the crackdown.
Lieutenant Colonel Koul Yi, Police Inspector of Russey Keo District, confirmed that the arrest of this drug trafficking suspect also confiscated two packages of drugs on 34-year-old Thach Kimsa at 1:00 pm On May 21, 2019, at the point of Street 103 in Group 1, Toul Thnang Village, Sangkat Toul Sangke 2, Khan Russey Keo, Phnom Penh.
