(Rattanakiri): Mr. Ly Thuch, Deputy Chairman of Rattanakiri Provincial Central Working Group, on May 20, 2019, paid a courtesy call on all Commune Councilors in Vern Sai District, Rattanakiri Province, who are ready to go to the polls. Provincial, municipal and district councils soon.
Mr. Ly Thuch, on behalf of Elder Bou Thong, Member of the Standing Committee and Chairman of the Ratanakkiri Provincial Assistance Team, conveyed greetings and condolences to all Commune Councilors present.
He stressed that the Cambodian People's Party is a party that sympathizes with the people and is a party that has the merit of liberating the people from the massacre and led the Royal Government to maintain economic growth and living standards. People are getting better day by day.
Mr. Ly Thuch continued that the Cambodian People's Party continues to unwaveringly support the fourth phase of the Royal Government's Rectangular Policy and Strategic Plan, which is striving to maintain peace, political stability, security, social order to be stronger and protect all social achievements. Achieved nation. At the same time, he called on the electorate to be present and vote for the Capital, Provincial and Municipal Councils.
